%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce1d3326426d8413f86dce414ff780b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: HeadChef_3_PhoneCall
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speaker: You
    text: Hello, who's this?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Head Chef Marco
    text: I need to tell you something. It's not him either.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab462b1b295b0465dad541ade8b6b05b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Head Chef Marco
    text: That night ... I followed her. I was worried, after everything with the
      breakup.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab462b1b295b0465dad541ade8b6b05b, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: You followed her?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Head Chef Marco
    text: I saw her pick something up near his building. Didn't get a good look.
      Then I heard the scream.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab462b1b295b0465dad541ade8b6b05b, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: And?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Head Chef Marco
    text: She ran. Still had it on her. When I caught up, she made me swear not to
      say anything... Especially not to the police. Said no one would believe her
      over a cop.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab462b1b295b0465dad541ade8b6b05b, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: A cop?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Head Chef Marco
    text: That's all she said. Wouldn't look at me after that.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab462b1b295b0465dad541ade8b6b05b, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: Why tell me now?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Head Chef Marco
    text: Because she's the one locked up. Not me. She wouldn't have gotten rid of
      something with her prints on it, she's probably still got it. Check her room.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab462b1b295b0465dad541ade8b6b05b, type: 3}
